 Theatre of Greece in 1952. In 1958, Minotis directed Maria Callas in a production of \"Medea\" presented in Dallas. The production was then seen at Covent Garden, Teatro alla Scala and Epidaurus. He also directed the Greek National Opera production of \"Norma\" with Callas in Epidaurus in 1960."
